<title>POLAND: Espebepe Q3 net swings to PLN 10 mln loss.</title>
<headline>Espebepe Q3 net swings to PLN 10 mln loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Espebepe results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
